<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000T US corn/soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000T US corn/soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Friday for a combined shipment comprising 18,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 12,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			 Pacific N.W.  Price/Futures</p>
<p> Corn    18,000    June 1-5	June 16-30</p>
<p> Soybean 12,000    June 1-5	June 16-30</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
